OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll announce a new health
OL,4,Aminister on Thursday,' says Burrows,
OL,5,Aafter Nesbitt row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe new health minister will be
OL,8,Fannounced on Thursday, the leader of
OL,9,Fthe UUP has said.
OL,11,FIt comes after Mike Nesbitt resigned
OL,12,Famid a row with Jon Burrows.
OL,14,FThe decision came following a clash
OL,15,Fover withdrawing emergency general
OL,16,Fsurgery services from Causeway Hospital
OL,17,Fwhere Nesbitt said the party leader had
OL,18,F"introduced a second red line" .
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
