OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll announce a new health
OL,4,Aminister on Thursday,' says Burrows,
OL,5,Aafter Nesbitt row
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking at a press conference at
OL,8,FStormont, Burrows said: "I was still
OL,9,Fprepared to work with Mike. He's taken
OL,10,Fa view that he's going to stand down. I
OL,11,Fnow need to look to the future and get
OL,12,Fthe best possible health minister."
